WEBVTT

00:17.609 --> 00:19.540
(Byeon Woo Seok)

00:21.150 --> 00:22.210
(CEO)

00:22.250 --> 00:23.250
(10 missed calls from CEO)

00:26.080 --> 00:27.919
(Kim Hye Yoon)

00:34.829 --> 00:37.800
(Lovely Runner)

00:43.260 --> 00:45.929
(Episode 12)

00:48.670 --> 00:49.869
It looks like you're in a good mood.

00:50.469 --> 00:52.969
Yes, I am. I'm so happy.

00:57.009 --> 00:58.039
By the way,

00:58.880 --> 01:00.179
are you not going to say anything?

01:01.480 --> 01:03.020
"It was cool. I was touched."

01:03.450 --> 01:05.090
You should say such obvious things.

01:05.749 --> 01:07.690
It was cool, of course.

01:10.289 --> 01:11.319
How cool was it?

01:12.130 --> 01:13.389
Well...

01:14.829 --> 01:16.429
This much.

01:17.029 --> 01:18.270
Come on. Only that much?

01:35.449 --> 01:36.649
This much?

01:37.720 --> 01:39.550
Gosh, I guess it was really cool.

01:43.589 --> 01:44.690
When you go back,

01:45.130 --> 01:47.190
should I sing a song for 20-year-old Sol?

01:48.130 --> 01:49.360
Will she fall in love with me then?

01:54.069 --> 01:55.740
Did you sing to show me?

01:59.770 --> 02:00.809
Of course.

02:02.339 --> 02:03.339
And I wanted...

02:03.709 --> 02:07.110
to sing on stage once again.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.750
How did it feel doing it?

02:10.919 --> 02:12.720
I'm not sure if I changed my mind...

02:13.520 --> 02:16.319
or if it's because I know my future,

02:17.990 --> 02:19.030
but what's for sure...

02:20.490 --> 02:21.600
is that my heart was racing.

02:21.830 --> 02:23.399
I told you.

02:26.069 --> 02:27.930
Oh, right. Take this.

02:28.400 --> 02:30.039
He gave it to me when I was going out after the concert.

02:30.639 --> 02:31.639
What?

02:31.940 --> 02:34.509
This is Mr. Kim's business card, isn't it?

02:35.239 --> 02:36.280
What did he say?

02:36.979 --> 02:37.979
Well,

02:38.380 --> 02:40.949
he said he wanted to make Eclipse debut and sign a contract with us.

02:41.750 --> 02:42.780
Really?

02:43.150 --> 02:45.720
That's great for you, Sun Jae.

02:45.789 --> 02:46.789
Does it make you that happy?

02:47.049 --> 02:48.220
Of course, it does.

02:48.759 --> 02:50.220
I thought I might've ruined your future.

02:50.220 --> 02:51.989
Do you know how worried I was?

02:53.560 --> 02:55.000
I told you not to say things like that.

02:59.069 --> 03:00.370
Sun Jae, I...

03:01.400 --> 03:02.870
have nothing more to wish for now.

03:04.639 --> 03:05.840
I have.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.440
I wish...

03:10.310 --> 03:11.750
time would pass by slowly.

03:20.049 --> 03:21.250
The flowers are falling too.

03:37.799 --> 03:40.810
(No Violence Allowed in Emergency Room)

03:42.940 --> 03:43.940
Excuse me.

03:44.639 --> 03:45.710
Where's my father?

03:46.549 --> 03:48.210
He's a police officer. I heard he had an accident.

03:48.280 --> 03:50.720
Go behind the curtain at the end.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.069
Dad.

04:21.079 --> 04:22.150
Are you crying?

04:29.220 --> 04:30.690
Why am I yawning so much?

04:32.489 --> 04:34.830
Oh, gosh. Dad?

04:35.030 --> 04:36.700
Were you crying, thinking I was dead?

04:36.799 --> 04:38.629
Me? I didn't cry.

04:39.970 --> 04:41.629
I came because of something else.

04:42.169 --> 04:44.340
- What are you doing here?
- Don't put up a show.

04:44.340 --> 04:45.970
You ran here because you were worried about me.

04:46.039 --> 04:47.039
The paramedic called me...

04:47.039 --> 04:48.239
and said things that made me think you were dying.

04:48.239 --> 04:49.379
That's why I ran here in shock.

04:49.710 --> 04:51.640
I got 20 stitches on my forehead.

04:52.210 --> 04:53.749
And I sprained my neck a little.

04:54.549 --> 04:57.820
I'm the never-dying officer on the violent crime team.

04:57.820 --> 05:00.320
"Never-dying," my foot. You're not invulnerable.

05:02.660 --> 05:04.989
So how were you injured?

05:04.989 --> 05:08.229
The suspect of the Juyang Reservoir murder case was arrested today,

05:08.229 --> 05:09.229
but he escaped...

05:09.229 --> 05:10.229
- while being transported.
- What?

05:10.229 --> 05:11.629
Kim, the key suspect,

05:11.869 --> 05:13.369
has been confirmed to have deliberately crashed the vehicle...

05:13.369 --> 05:15.739
- on a national highway...
- Oh, my gosh. What's going on?

05:15.739 --> 05:16.999
- leading to a mountain road...
- The front of the car...

05:16.999 --> 05:18.640
- is completely destroyed.
- escaped in the ensuing chaos.

05:18.640 --> 05:20.140
- Are the people all right?
- The police have decided...

05:20.140 --> 05:22.140
to release a composite sketch of the suspect...

05:22.140 --> 05:24.780
- to track him down.
- Is it broken?

05:24.910 --> 05:26.450
- The bathroom door is weird.
- Please take a look at the sketch.

05:26.450 --> 05:29.119
What? That's because the house is old.

05:29.119 --> 05:31.150
- We should move into an apartment.
- His name is Kim Young Soo.

05:31.150 --> 05:33.489
He has a tall and robust build, standing at just over 180cm tall,

05:33.689 --> 05:36.020
with long, mono-lidded eyes as a distinctive feature.

05:36.289 --> 05:38.689
- The police are working...
- Kim Young Soo?

05:38.689 --> 05:41.059
with neighbouring jurisdictions to track down the fugitive's movements.

05:41.059 --> 05:42.799
We urge any citizens who may have witnessed the perpetrator...

05:42.799 --> 05:44.400
to come forward with information without delay.

05:44.559 --> 05:47.070
Please take a look at the sketch once again.

05:47.429 --> 05:49.900
The police are searching for Kim Young Soo, the suspect.

05:50.739 --> 05:54.070
We urge anyone who sees the suspect to promptly report it...

05:54.070 --> 05:56.710
to the nearest police station to prevent further victims.

06:00.280 --> 06:02.580
The suspect in the Juyang Reservoir murder case,

06:03.049 --> 06:04.379
Kim Young Soo.

06:04.379 --> 06:06.119
("Police Are Searching for Suspect in Juyang Reservoir Murder Case")

06:08.249 --> 06:10.160
My dad is chasing after Kim Young Soo.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.160
So mind your own business.

06:15.929 --> 06:17.960
(Gold Videos and DVDs)

06:34.850 --> 06:36.950
What? You want me to come here?

06:37.280 --> 06:39.390
Yes. On May 10.

06:39.590 --> 06:42.720
Can you please hide near this building that day?

06:42.890 --> 06:44.689
On ten? Why?

06:45.660 --> 06:47.460
Do you think he will come again?

06:47.929 --> 06:50.960
He was arrested near here. He won't come again.

06:51.030 --> 06:52.070
He...

06:52.799 --> 06:53.830
will probably come.

06:55.030 --> 06:56.470
If it's because you're anxious,

06:56.600 --> 06:58.539
Your witness protection measures are already in place.

06:59.239 --> 07:00.710
If you're still worried,

07:00.910 --> 07:02.179
how about discussing with your family...

07:02.179 --> 07:04.140
the option of temporarily relocating your residence?

07:04.140 --> 07:06.410
If Kim Young Soo notices that there are police officers near the place,

07:07.150 --> 07:08.179
you'll never be able to catch him.

07:08.720 --> 07:10.049
I'm not saying this because I'm anxious.

07:10.049 --> 07:12.090
I'm asking you because he needs to be arrested.

07:12.720 --> 07:13.950
Are you thinking...

07:14.419 --> 07:16.489
of luring him here?

07:16.890 --> 07:18.729
You can't do that. It's dangerous for you.

07:19.960 --> 07:21.689
You can prevent him.

07:23.729 --> 07:25.330
What on earth are you thinking...

07:25.330 --> 07:27.999
I can't say why I'm doing this or what will happen here...

07:27.999 --> 07:29.669
even though I want to.

07:29.939 --> 07:31.869
Please don't ask me anything.

07:32.140 --> 07:34.570
Can't you please just think that it's to protect me...

07:34.910 --> 07:37.580
and do as I say?

07:38.539 --> 07:41.979
Only then can you catch him.

08:12.210 --> 08:14.179
What happens that day?

08:17.450 --> 08:21.189
I said you should think about yourself only.

08:21.619 --> 08:26.489
Why did you act like a fool and let something like that happen to you?

08:26.729 --> 08:28.929
Just act like you don't know me.

08:28.929 --> 08:32.030
Whatever I do, whatever happens to me, please...

08:32.030 --> 08:35.129
Please just leave me alone.

08:37.499 --> 08:39.169
No matter what happens...

08:41.340 --> 08:42.979
How can I act like I don't know you, Sol?

08:47.910 --> 08:49.520
Why are you trying to bear the consequences alone?

08:57.590 --> 08:59.460
- Geum!
- Oh, my.

09:01.930 --> 09:03.899
What do I do? She's so cute.

09:05.999 --> 09:07.700
Hyun Ju!

09:07.700 --> 09:09.100
Geum!

09:09.840 --> 09:13.609
- I missed you.
- Me too.

09:28.220 --> 09:30.090
Oh, my gosh, did they fall?

09:30.090 --> 09:33.389
- No!
- Oh, no.

09:34.090 --> 09:35.229
Yes, Sun Jae.

09:37.560 --> 09:39.269
Are you okay?

09:42.499 --> 09:45.840
Did you eat something wrong?

09:46.040 --> 09:47.609
Why did you hug me and dive into the water?

09:47.840 --> 09:49.810
- Were you trying to kill me?
- No.

09:50.409 --> 09:52.509
Sol was suddenly passing by.

09:52.680 --> 09:54.080
I got flustered.

09:54.080 --> 09:55.920
Was she passing by?

09:58.180 --> 09:59.350
We were almost in trouble.

10:00.019 --> 10:01.489
I told you, my Gold.

10:01.489 --> 10:03.220
What would you have done without me?

10:03.220 --> 10:04.759
I know.

10:04.759 --> 10:07.359
Princess Hyun Ju, you're the only one for me.

10:09.830 --> 10:12.930
By the way, our clothes are completely wet. What do we do?

10:14.470 --> 10:16.269
Aren't you cold? Should we hug?

10:16.269 --> 10:17.940
- Yes.
- Should we hug? Should we do that?

10:18.269 --> 10:19.509
- It's cold.
- It's cold.

10:19.710 --> 10:20.970
- It's so cold.
- Let's go.

10:21.440 --> 10:23.779
Hey, what are you doing?

10:26.249 --> 10:27.850
(Yeonseo University)

10:28.149 --> 10:30.050
- Oh, my.
- Is it your core course?

10:30.279 --> 10:32.249
No, it's an elective, but it was cancelled.

10:32.420 --> 10:34.920
They should've told us beforehand. I brought heavy books for no reason.

10:35.759 --> 10:36.759
Give them to me.

10:37.989 --> 10:38.989
Let's go.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.899
Mom! Grandma!

10:50.070 --> 10:51.200
Geum!

10:58.239 --> 10:59.609
Did everyone go out?

11:01.450 --> 11:03.080
- Please excuse me for a moment.
- What?

11:11.060 --> 11:14.129
Give me a minute. I'll put the books in the room.

11:14.229 --> 11:15.359
Let me look around the room.

11:16.259 --> 11:17.930
What? No!

11:21.930 --> 11:23.999
Why would you look around? There's nothing to see.

11:25.369 --> 11:26.639
Because I'm curious.

11:26.940 --> 11:28.670
I want to see how your room looks.

11:29.940 --> 11:31.540
It's not untidy like this every day.

11:31.540 --> 11:33.050
It's usually very neat.

11:36.320 --> 11:37.680
It looks so insecure.

11:38.119 --> 11:39.619
I should install a window guard first.

11:39.619 --> 11:40.720
What did you say?

11:42.420 --> 11:43.820
Does this even lock properly?

11:45.790 --> 11:47.659
Yes, it does.

11:47.690 --> 11:48.999
Make sure to lock the window when you sleep.

11:49.800 --> 11:52.499
And the stun gun you had before.

11:52.970 --> 11:54.399
- Where is it?
- Sorry?

11:55.899 --> 11:56.940
Oh, right.

12:00.009 --> 12:01.239
- This?
- Yes.

12:12.519 --> 12:13.950
Put this on your bedside when you sleep.

12:23.060 --> 12:24.529
Why are you suddenly acting like this?

12:25.129 --> 12:27.300
Someone might carry my girlfriend away. Why?

12:28.070 --> 12:29.170
Because you're so pretty.

12:32.570 --> 12:34.009
Can you say things like that too?

12:35.509 --> 12:37.009
Who would carry me away?

12:46.019 --> 12:47.090
Who is it?

12:50.019 --> 12:51.820
You said Sol would be attending the core course lecture.

12:52.259 --> 12:54.460
Was it cancelled? What do we do?

12:55.729 --> 12:57.830
Hide here. Let me handle this.

13:00.970 --> 13:02.269
My hair is stuck.

13:03.100 --> 13:04.100
Careful.

13:07.170 --> 13:08.170
Let's go.

13:15.850 --> 13:17.680
You stay here. Don't come out.

13:31.029 --> 13:32.369
- Gosh.
- Gosh.

13:32.899 --> 13:33.930
Sorry.

13:34.670 --> 13:35.869
I told you to stay inside.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.420
Was the door closed...

13:57.590 --> 13:58.859
earlier as well?

14:51.509 --> 14:52.810
Gosh, what is it?

14:56.479 --> 14:58.019
- There's no one?
- No.

14:59.190 --> 15:00.249
Let's go out.

15:09.560 --> 15:10.560
Now.

15:59.040 --> 16:01.379
It's dangerous for you. Go out and report to the police quickly.

16:02.180 --> 16:03.619
Okay.

16:37.420 --> 16:38.420
No!

16:51.359 --> 16:53.800
Geum!

16:58.300 --> 16:59.340
You...

17:19.889 --> 17:20.989
It's disgusting.

17:22.260 --> 17:23.260
Hey.

17:23.730 --> 17:25.760
Despite the situation, you can't say I'm disgusting!

17:25.800 --> 17:28.530
So it started around this time.

17:28.730 --> 17:30.169
You hit on my friend!

17:30.169 --> 17:31.939
No, Sol, I hit on him.

17:31.939 --> 17:34.369
What were you trying to do here when there was no one around?

17:34.669 --> 17:36.540
Why is she wearing my clothes?

17:36.540 --> 17:38.810
I came to get changed for some unavoidable reasons.

17:39.040 --> 17:40.709
It takes one to know one.

17:40.709 --> 17:43.520
How about you? What are you doing with this guy in the empty house?

17:43.619 --> 17:45.750
I carried her heavy books to put them in the house.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.820
You followed her into the house, knowing there was no one,

17:47.820 --> 17:49.290
because you had another intention, didn't you?

17:50.389 --> 17:52.020
You got those weird stuff...

17:52.020 --> 17:54.389
in the bag again, right?

17:54.629 --> 17:56.399
I said those weren't mine.

17:56.459 --> 17:58.000
Don't talk back to me!

17:58.959 --> 18:00.000
Sister.

18:00.899 --> 18:02.570
Let's settle this.

18:03.500 --> 18:05.469
I'll give you guys my permission to date.

18:05.770 --> 18:07.409
You give us your permission to date too.

18:07.669 --> 18:10.679
You don't have to permit us. We're not breaking up.

18:11.310 --> 18:14.850
How dare you talk back to me?

18:14.850 --> 18:16.919
How dare you ask him to treat you like an older brother?

18:16.980 --> 18:19.050
You can't say that. He's still your older brother.

18:19.050 --> 18:20.449
That's rude.

18:20.919 --> 18:23.359
"Rude?"

18:27.790 --> 18:28.959
Don't get mad.

18:31.000 --> 18:36.570
As expected, Princess Hyun Ju is the only one who cares about me.

18:36.969 --> 18:42.270
My Gold, why are you treated like this at home?

18:43.109 --> 18:44.280
I should just...

18:45.510 --> 18:47.050
Do you want to get an electric shock again?

18:47.209 --> 18:49.179
That wasn't strong enough, was it?

18:49.179 --> 18:50.280
- Give me your neck.
- Hold it in.

18:50.280 --> 18:51.949
- Give me your neck!
- Put it down.

18:51.949 --> 18:53.149
What are you going to do with the apple?

18:53.149 --> 18:54.990
I'm going to throw it at you. I can throw this too!

19:03.060 --> 19:04.159
That girl...

19:04.159 --> 19:06.399
Even after I warned her, she...

19:07.929 --> 19:10.240
If you hate it that much, you should stop them.

19:11.669 --> 19:14.109
When you gain something, you lose something.

19:14.469 --> 19:15.909
Happiness always comes with a cost.

19:15.909 --> 19:17.409
If I never got married,

19:17.639 --> 19:19.750
I would have never been able to see my beautiful children.

19:21.750 --> 19:24.080
I can't stop them when I think about Kkomul, their baby.

19:25.550 --> 19:28.350
Are they meant to be together no matter what?

19:29.520 --> 19:30.859
If there's a fate that doesn't change...

19:30.859 --> 19:32.389
no matter how much you try to change,

19:33.490 --> 19:35.030
it means the choice didn't change.

19:35.830 --> 19:37.959
- What?
- There are choices you make...

19:38.459 --> 19:40.030
even though you know the consequences.

19:41.000 --> 19:42.469
Because you like it.

19:45.969 --> 19:47.070
You're right.

19:47.609 --> 19:49.169
I gave her a chance to choose,

19:49.169 --> 19:51.040
but she blew up the chance. I can't do anything about it.

19:52.409 --> 19:54.449
I guess they love each other so much that they're inseparable.

19:55.149 --> 19:56.619
Yes. Think that that's what it is.

19:58.250 --> 19:59.790
Oh, right. When are you going to sign a contract?

19:59.990 --> 20:01.590
I haven't heard an answer from In Hyuk yet.

20:02.090 --> 20:04.389
I couldn't reach him for days.

20:05.020 --> 20:07.530
Did something happen? I'm worried.

20:12.330 --> 20:14.030
It's not time for you to worry about him.

20:18.439 --> 20:19.439
Sol.

20:20.109 --> 20:21.770
- You know...
- Yes?

20:27.149 --> 20:28.379
Never mind. It's nothing.

20:36.260 --> 20:38.320
(Gold Videos and DVDs)

20:46.230 --> 20:47.899
(Gold Videos and DVDs)

20:50.139 --> 20:51.340
On May 10.

20:51.740 --> 20:54.840
Can you please hide near this building that day?

20:55.169 --> 20:57.609
He will probably come.

20:58.379 --> 20:59.679
May 10.

21:06.290 --> 21:08.449
(May 4)

21:12.060 --> 21:13.959
(Gold Videos and DVDs)

21:21.070 --> 21:22.070
Gosh.

21:22.169 --> 21:23.199
In Hyuk.

21:24.899 --> 21:26.070
What is this?

21:35.780 --> 21:37.379
Hey, were you at home?

21:39.750 --> 21:40.820
What are you doing?

21:44.490 --> 21:46.429
- Good morning.
- What are you doing here?

21:46.490 --> 21:47.530
Oh, my.

21:48.830 --> 21:50.459
In Hyuk put up this house for rent and moved out.

21:51.060 --> 21:52.629
So I'm using this as our office. Why?

21:54.969 --> 21:56.399
Sol, you came too?

21:57.040 --> 21:58.070
Are you all right?

21:59.639 --> 22:01.909
He put up his house for rent? All of a sudden?

22:02.939 --> 22:04.909
In Hyuk was shocked when he watched the show.

22:05.010 --> 22:06.609
He immediately packed up and went to his hometown.

22:06.679 --> 22:08.750
- Did you not know?
- The show? What show?

22:08.750 --> 22:12.750
(Superstar K 3 Voice Cracks)

22:15.449 --> 22:16.760
This is unbelievable.

22:19.260 --> 22:20.490
Darn it.

22:21.330 --> 22:22.929
Hey, are you crying?

22:26.899 --> 22:28.030
Leave me alone.

22:32.540 --> 22:35.310
You didn't care about your friend because you were busy dating.

22:36.980 --> 22:39.510
You forgot about friendship because you were crazy about love.

22:42.179 --> 22:44.080
Do you know where his hometown is?

22:44.149 --> 22:46.149
How would I know when you don't know it?

22:47.189 --> 22:48.250
I know.

22:48.419 --> 22:49.990
As a member of Eclipse's first fan club,

22:51.020 --> 22:53.990
I even know the colour of the roof at his house in his hometown.

22:54.129 --> 22:55.790
What? "Fan club?"

22:57.060 --> 22:58.159
Where is it?

23:00.030 --> 23:02.000
It's a bit far, though.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.169
How should we get there?

23:03.570 --> 23:06.409
Should we ride a bus or a train?

23:06.840 --> 23:09.369
Why bother when we can drive there?

23:09.980 --> 23:12.310
Did you get an imported car because you made some money?

23:14.310 --> 23:16.679
With the money, you should have saved it to buy a house.

23:17.449 --> 23:19.250
You're still immature.

23:19.350 --> 23:20.919
What do you think? It's sick, isn't it?

23:21.490 --> 23:22.820
Here.

23:24.020 --> 23:25.260
Let me introduce my Sunny to you.

23:25.260 --> 23:26.359
"Sunny," my foot.

23:26.530 --> 23:28.060
Did you offer a ride to brag about it?

23:28.060 --> 23:29.260
Of course.

23:29.560 --> 23:31.000
Why would I give you a ride if I can't brag about it?

23:33.600 --> 23:36.699
Gosh, it's hard to get rid of the smell of bird droppings.

23:37.000 --> 23:39.169
Darn those birds.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.969
Why the heck did it poop on me?

23:44.240 --> 23:45.310
What?

23:48.209 --> 23:49.379
What's wrong with it?

23:49.480 --> 23:50.580
Why isn't the water running?

23:53.590 --> 23:54.649
Did they cut off the water?

23:55.889 --> 23:57.020
My eyes hurt.

23:58.020 --> 23:59.730
Gosh. I didn't keep any water.

24:00.060 --> 24:01.990
Darn it. My eyes!

24:05.730 --> 24:07.669
Drinking water. That's right.

24:08.030 --> 24:09.699
There's always a solution to everything.

24:13.969 --> 24:15.040
What?

24:20.109 --> 24:21.580
The bathroom door is weird.

24:22.949 --> 24:24.149
My goodness!

24:26.149 --> 24:28.090
My eyes!

24:35.859 --> 24:37.060
That's wrong.

24:37.060 --> 24:38.800
Even when I think about it, it's still wrong.

24:39.730 --> 24:42.369
Even though my eyes are burning,

24:43.770 --> 24:44.939
It's wrong.

24:58.879 --> 25:00.990
I'm locked in. What should I do?

25:01.490 --> 25:02.959
I left my phone outside too.

25:11.330 --> 25:12.629
Hello?

25:14.230 --> 25:16.129
A man is locked in!

25:24.139 --> 25:26.109
Gosh. That noise.

25:26.109 --> 25:28.909
My face and brain are shaking.

25:28.909 --> 25:30.080
Gosh.

25:30.080 --> 25:32.449
I don't know what I'm eating because I can't focus.

25:33.119 --> 25:34.219
Here!

25:35.320 --> 25:36.659
Hey!

25:37.119 --> 25:41.459
Make the dog stop barking!

25:42.389 --> 25:45.000
That horrible dog!

25:55.740 --> 25:58.040
No one can hear me because of the noise.

25:58.040 --> 26:00.609
There's a construction as well as a barking dog.

26:03.679 --> 26:04.919
Darn it.

26:06.149 --> 26:07.290
I have no choice...

26:07.889 --> 26:09.859
but to wait until Sun Jae gets home.

26:23.840 --> 26:25.540
Are you kidding me? Push the gas.

26:25.540 --> 26:27.709
Hey. What if Sunny gets scratched...

26:27.709 --> 26:29.469
from a pebble?

26:29.570 --> 26:31.310
It'll take forever to get there.

26:31.409 --> 26:33.780
Why did you even get a new car?

26:33.909 --> 26:35.209
You'll ruin it after treasuring it so much.

26:35.280 --> 26:36.379
Goodness.

26:36.649 --> 26:39.149
Korean people are so impatient.

26:39.419 --> 26:40.790
They don't have room for relaxation.

26:40.949 --> 26:42.449
Enjoy the view and all.

26:43.090 --> 26:44.219
"The view?"

26:49.260 --> 26:50.359
Well,

26:50.359 --> 26:51.929
shouldn't you be faster than a cultivator, at least?

26:54.300 --> 26:55.830
Hey. Is this the right address?

26:56.669 --> 26:57.770
I think we're almost there.

26:58.639 --> 27:01.709
It's a red-roofed house we can see right from this beach.

27:03.139 --> 27:04.310
Hey.

27:04.480 --> 27:05.580
Isn't that In Hyuk?

27:21.359 --> 27:23.230
- What is he doing?
- In Hyuk!

27:27.399 --> 27:28.570
In Hyuk!

27:31.169 --> 27:33.169
- In Hyuk!
- Hey, In Hyuk!

27:37.010 --> 27:38.709
Hey, In Hyuk!

27:38.709 --> 27:39.909
In Hyuk!

27:39.949 --> 27:41.679
- In Hyuk...
- In Hyuk!

27:42.409 --> 27:44.119
Sun Jae, are you all right?

27:44.750 --> 27:46.250
- I'm all right.
- Hey, In Hyuk.

27:47.250 --> 27:48.449
- In Hyuk!
- In Hyuk!

27:48.820 --> 27:50.590
- In Hyuk!
- Hey!

27:54.629 --> 27:55.689
Oh, no!

27:58.530 --> 28:00.070
Grab him. Come here.

28:00.070 --> 28:01.169
What?

28:01.270 --> 28:02.429
What are you doing here?

28:02.469 --> 28:03.939
Hey, hold on.

28:03.939 --> 28:05.040
Get out of here.

28:05.600 --> 28:06.709
Hey.

28:07.040 --> 28:08.109
What?

28:08.469 --> 28:09.840
What is going...

28:11.480 --> 28:13.550
- Is everyone all right?
- Is this why you came back here?

28:13.550 --> 28:14.980
- What?
- It's not the end of the world.

28:15.350 --> 28:17.280
You should persistently live on. Why do you try to die?

28:18.980 --> 28:20.250
Who tried to die?

28:21.689 --> 28:24.659
Gosh. The floatie I like has drifted far away now.

28:25.560 --> 28:27.929
Why did you come here suddenly and make a fuss?

28:28.889 --> 28:30.330
For goodness' sake!

28:31.899 --> 28:34.129
You should have told us earlier. I'm all wet now.

28:34.169 --> 28:36.300
"Told you?" You hit the water as you please.

28:36.300 --> 28:37.439
No.

28:37.740 --> 28:39.199
What should we do? Look!

28:39.199 --> 28:40.609
Why? What?

28:44.679 --> 28:46.080
No, Sunny!

28:46.280 --> 28:48.010
Sunny, no!

28:48.080 --> 28:49.709
No!

28:51.820 --> 28:52.980
Sunny.

28:53.149 --> 28:54.490
My Sunny!

28:56.149 --> 28:58.859
No!

29:01.889 --> 29:03.659
Take a photo of your memories.

29:04.459 --> 29:06.359
Take a photo of your memories.

29:07.399 --> 29:09.469
Take a photo of your memories.

29:10.169 --> 29:11.340
Hey, there.

29:12.899 --> 29:14.139
Do you want me to take a photo?

30:05.490 --> 30:09.459
I heard your father treated In Hyuk as if he was his son.

30:09.530 --> 30:12.629
I wanted to go and thank him, but I couldn't.

30:13.030 --> 30:14.230
You drink makgeolli, right?

30:16.369 --> 30:18.369
Okay, here.

30:20.540 --> 30:22.139
I couldn't prepare much.

30:22.310 --> 30:24.679
If I had known you were coming, I would have prepared properly.

30:24.740 --> 30:27.709
Exactly. In Hyuk's friends came all the way from Seoul.

30:27.709 --> 30:29.679
They'll criticize us for not treating them well.

30:29.780 --> 30:31.719
No way.

30:31.879 --> 30:33.020
These are a lot.

30:33.149 --> 30:34.820
I thought it was a king's meal.

30:36.619 --> 30:38.520
I still feel bad about it.

30:39.119 --> 30:40.689
I'll get a chicken.

30:40.730 --> 30:42.929
- No. It's enough already.
- No.

30:43.330 --> 30:44.899
Hurry and eat before he goes and kills a chicken.

30:45.060 --> 30:46.300
- Thanks for the food.
- Thanks for the food.

30:50.139 --> 30:51.199
By the way,

30:51.240 --> 30:52.570
what's wrong with him?

30:59.080 --> 31:00.750
Do you want a cup of makgeolli?

31:13.159 --> 31:14.260
Gosh.

31:14.629 --> 31:16.389
It's raining all of a sudden.

31:18.330 --> 31:19.699
Good gracious.

31:23.340 --> 31:24.740
Hello, this is Gold Videos.

31:24.969 --> 31:26.040
Yes, Sol.

31:26.840 --> 31:27.909
Where?

31:28.709 --> 31:31.080
Danpo-ri? Where is that?

31:31.939 --> 31:33.949
Why did you go that far?

31:34.949 --> 31:37.820
How did the car get sunk into the sea?

31:38.050 --> 31:40.320
Also, I know you're a grownup now,

31:40.320 --> 31:42.449
but you shouldn't sleep out with your boyfriend.

31:42.449 --> 31:44.790
The parents of Sun Jae's friend are here too.

31:44.820 --> 31:47.030
Do you want me to hand my phone to them if you can't believe me?

31:47.490 --> 31:48.730
Forget it.

31:48.889 --> 31:51.429
Anyway, don't bother the parents.

31:51.429 --> 31:53.230
Be nice and polite, and enjoy it before you come back.

31:53.730 --> 31:54.830
Okay.

31:55.399 --> 31:56.840
Gosh. They're really enjoying their youth.

31:59.500 --> 32:01.409
What? Did he leave?

32:13.689 --> 32:15.619
(Soon-to-be demolished)

32:19.320 --> 32:21.260
(Soon-to-be demolished)

32:21.260 --> 32:22.990
(Who is this development for?)

32:34.810 --> 32:36.780
The water is so cold. Your hands will get chapped.

32:38.780 --> 32:40.040
Gosh. Look how red they are.

32:42.709 --> 32:44.020
It's okay.

32:46.250 --> 32:47.949
Go back to Seoul at once.

32:48.649 --> 32:49.889
How can we?

32:50.659 --> 32:52.859
My Sunny is in the cold sea.

32:54.230 --> 32:55.429
Gosh.

32:56.290 --> 32:57.330
Why did I give them a ride?

32:57.330 --> 32:58.800
This is annoying.

33:05.500 --> 33:06.570
By the way, In Hyuk,

33:06.740 --> 33:08.740
does your goat go on a picnic all on its own?

33:09.469 --> 33:10.679
What?

33:11.240 --> 33:12.740
Gosh. It ran out again.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.379
Hey, go and catch Soondol.

33:16.280 --> 33:17.379
Soondol!

33:23.689 --> 33:25.320
- Soondol.
- Soondol.

33:25.490 --> 33:26.760
Hey, come here.

33:28.260 --> 33:29.730
- Come here.
- Hey.

33:29.730 --> 33:31.199
- Soondol.
- Come.

33:31.359 --> 33:32.699
- Come.
- Come here.

33:32.899 --> 33:34.429
Soondol.

33:34.669 --> 33:35.969
Soondol.

33:37.070 --> 33:38.139
Hey, Soondol.

33:39.270 --> 33:40.270
Goodness.

33:41.570 --> 33:43.040
Here. Soondol.

33:43.369 --> 33:44.409
Soondol!

33:47.050 --> 33:48.050
Soondol.

33:50.520 --> 33:52.850
- Sol, are you all right?
- Yes.

33:53.590 --> 33:54.649
Hey, Soondol.

33:54.649 --> 33:56.619
- Soondol.
- Soondol.

33:57.359 --> 33:58.520
Close in.

33:58.520 --> 34:00.760
- Stay there.
- Wait right there.

34:00.990 --> 34:02.260
Come here.

34:04.459 --> 34:06.100
- No.
- Is this okay?

34:06.100 --> 34:07.199
Don't go that way.

34:07.669 --> 34:09.699
I got him.

34:09.699 --> 34:10.770
I finally got him.

34:10.770 --> 34:13.540
Gosh. Why do you keep running away from home?

34:13.840 --> 34:15.010
I'm glad we got him.

34:15.639 --> 34:17.780
Let's go home. I'm exhausted.

34:18.080 --> 34:19.080
- Let's go.
- Okay.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.029
- Hey, come here.
- It's cold.

34:40.270 --> 34:41.369
Gosh.

34:42.369 --> 34:44.839
They said they'd wash up, but they're having fun.

34:45.940 --> 34:46.969
It's pretty.

34:49.739 --> 34:50.880
We said we'd come see the sea...

34:51.880 --> 34:53.310
before you return.

34:54.179 --> 34:55.250
And this is how we got here.

34:56.580 --> 34:57.580
I know.

34:58.080 --> 35:00.219
But I'm still happy that I came with you.

35:02.250 --> 35:03.250
Me too.

35:04.290 --> 35:05.360
Hey.

35:06.290 --> 35:08.230
- Did you come here to date?
- Yes.

35:10.460 --> 35:11.460
"Yes?"

35:11.830 --> 35:13.199
- Hey, get him.
- Get him.

35:13.360 --> 35:14.730
- Get him. Come here.
- Hey.

35:15.500 --> 35:16.500
Sol!

35:16.600 --> 35:17.639
Don't come this way.

35:18.069 --> 35:19.069
Don't do it.

35:19.239 --> 35:20.310
Don't even try it.

35:24.610 --> 35:25.779
Come on!

35:25.880 --> 35:27.580
- You are ridiculous.
- Come here.

35:34.219 --> 35:35.219
There.

35:38.119 --> 35:39.190
Come here.

35:41.230 --> 35:42.489
- Do you want to do it?
- Try it.

35:46.799 --> 35:47.799
Sol.

36:24.440 --> 36:25.839
Are you really going to quit the band?

36:29.310 --> 36:31.639
In Hyuk, to be honest,

36:33.239 --> 36:34.580
I'm a bit scared.

36:36.080 --> 36:38.819
For me to play music while all I used to do was swim.

36:39.719 --> 36:41.449
It's a path I haven't taken before.

36:42.219 --> 36:43.319
It's scary.

36:43.790 --> 36:44.860
But...

36:46.589 --> 36:48.529
I think I can do it well if I do it with you.

36:51.330 --> 36:53.000
I don't know when I'll die,

36:53.730 --> 36:55.000
but if there's the brightest moment...

36:55.900 --> 36:57.799
in my youth,

37:01.710 --> 37:03.069
I want it to be with you.

37:09.150 --> 37:10.250
Whatever.

37:12.850 --> 37:13.850
Hey.

37:14.049 --> 37:16.190
You've become smooth-tongued after dating Sol.

37:17.089 --> 37:18.489
You're a man, but you're crying.

37:18.659 --> 37:20.219
- You fool.
- Hey, what?

37:20.219 --> 37:21.659
Hey, stop crying now.

37:21.659 --> 37:23.029
- In Hyuk.
- Okay. Let go of me.

37:26.830 --> 37:28.170
- Gosh.
- Goodness.

37:32.739 --> 37:34.509
Here. Pick one.

37:36.710 --> 37:37.739
I'll get this.

37:39.310 --> 37:40.339
Gosh.

37:43.650 --> 37:46.850
I'm relieved to see you smile after coming here.

37:48.819 --> 37:51.759
I was worried you'd be terrified by the news on Kim Young Soo.

37:56.790 --> 37:59.699
I'm not terrified. I'm all right.

38:02.799 --> 38:05.440
But why do you keep worrying about me recently? It's unlike you.

38:05.839 --> 38:08.310
Why? Do you regret losing me?

38:08.540 --> 38:10.739
Goodness. You should have treated me well when you went out with me.

38:10.739 --> 38:11.880
The bus has left already.

38:13.480 --> 38:14.580
I know.

38:15.350 --> 38:16.779
I realized it after the bus left.

38:18.619 --> 38:20.049
I really liked you back then.

38:21.389 --> 38:23.049
I'm telling you I didn't use you.

38:25.159 --> 38:26.719
I know it's late,

38:27.290 --> 38:29.159
but if that hurt you before,

38:29.860 --> 38:31.130
this is the truth, so get it over with.

38:36.000 --> 38:38.739
Okay. Thank you for telling me now, at least.

38:40.239 --> 38:42.569
Gosh. My self-esteem is boosted...

38:42.940 --> 38:45.739
because the popular boy at our school had really liked me.

38:47.909 --> 38:49.909
I'm not as bad as you think.

38:50.750 --> 38:51.779
I know.

38:51.949 --> 38:53.679
Even though I told you such stuff,

38:54.489 --> 38:56.219
I know you're a good person.

38:56.319 --> 38:58.489
Thanks to someone, I hear that I'm a good person.

39:05.560 --> 39:06.560
Tae Seong.

39:07.230 --> 39:08.369
Did you buy ice cream?

39:08.369 --> 39:09.600
Guys, pick one.

39:18.310 --> 39:19.480
Hey, move over.

39:45.199 --> 39:46.199
Wait.

39:48.310 --> 39:49.540
Where's my phone?

39:49.540 --> 39:51.480
You had it when you called your mom.

39:51.480 --> 39:53.850
Yes. I put it in my pocket.

39:54.080 --> 39:55.650
Gosh. Did I drop it somewhere?

39:57.750 --> 39:59.480
You fell while catching the goat.

39:59.850 --> 40:01.150
Maybe you dropped it then.

40:04.319 --> 40:06.860
- Sol, are you all right?
- Yes.

40:09.489 --> 40:10.600
I think so.

40:12.259 --> 40:13.330
Let's go and check.

40:13.529 --> 40:14.670
You two can get back.

40:39.089 --> 40:40.589
(Samwon Supermarket)

40:58.310 --> 41:00.080
- What was that?
- What?

41:02.080 --> 41:04.949
No. It's nothing.

41:17.730 --> 41:20.259
I'll go and find it, so stay right here.

41:47.929 --> 41:48.989
I found it!

41:52.460 --> 41:53.500
Sol?

41:54.699 --> 41:55.730
Sol.

42:00.540 --> 42:01.569
Where is she?

42:07.779 --> 42:08.779
Sol!

42:09.850 --> 42:10.850
Sol!

42:11.719 --> 42:12.719
Im Sol!

42:13.480 --> 42:15.290
Sol, Im Sol!

42:15.290 --> 42:16.319
Sol!

42:18.989 --> 42:19.989
Sol!

42:26.100 --> 42:27.130
You can't disappear without telling me...

42:27.130 --> 42:28.369
when you don't have your phone.

42:28.869 --> 42:30.000
Sun Jae.

42:32.869 --> 42:34.069
Why are you sitting here like this?

42:35.210 --> 42:37.380
- Did you fall?
- What?

42:39.480 --> 42:40.480
Yes.

42:40.710 --> 42:42.949
I came to see the view, but I tripped.

42:43.179 --> 42:44.219
Let me see.

42:46.420 --> 42:47.489
You're not hurt.

42:48.619 --> 42:50.989
How are your ankles? Do they hurt?

42:55.960 --> 42:57.230
Let's hurry back.

42:57.560 --> 42:59.230
It's getting dark and scary.

43:01.569 --> 43:02.569
Okay.

43:08.869 --> 43:10.639
I told you to stay right there.

43:11.279 --> 43:12.839
Why did you roam around without being afraid?

43:14.009 --> 43:15.009
I'm sorry.

43:17.380 --> 43:19.549
Why are you overprotective these days?

43:20.619 --> 43:21.650
Sol.

43:22.489 --> 43:23.549
Do you...

43:24.889 --> 43:26.119
have something to tell me?

43:32.699 --> 43:35.369
No, I don't. Why?

43:37.440 --> 43:38.469
It's just...

43:38.699 --> 43:42.339
I want you to tell me everything when you're hurt and worn off...

43:43.170 --> 43:44.339
without hiding anything.

43:45.210 --> 43:46.509
Don't try to bear it alone.

43:49.009 --> 43:51.150
Okay. I'll do that.

43:51.880 --> 43:52.920
You're lying.

43:53.549 --> 43:55.089
You're not going to tell me to protect me.

44:02.389 --> 44:03.460
But Sol,

44:04.130 --> 44:05.929
no matter how hard you try to hide it,

44:06.900 --> 44:08.199
I'll come to you that day.

44:09.029 --> 44:10.069
This is the choice...

44:11.199 --> 44:12.799
I cannot avoid.

44:18.009 --> 44:19.080
Let's go.

44:19.310 --> 44:20.310
Okay.

44:32.060 --> 44:33.290
I'm so hungry.

44:35.889 --> 44:38.529
Darn it. I screamed profusely.

44:38.860 --> 44:40.259
My voice went hoarse.

44:43.199 --> 44:45.270
Somebody help me!

44:46.239 --> 44:47.639
Help me!

44:48.710 --> 44:50.770
Darn it. It's making me hungrier.

44:52.179 --> 44:55.250
I'm starving here. When will you come home, my son?

45:04.460 --> 45:06.659
Yes. That's it.

45:08.290 --> 45:11.199
I should use my firm body to break down the door...

45:11.460 --> 45:12.699
and escape.

45:21.569 --> 45:24.040
Darn it. I should've thought of this sooner.

45:24.110 --> 45:25.940
The door is already worn down anyway.

45:26.279 --> 45:27.650
It's about time that I get a new door.

45:49.969 --> 45:51.069
What's going on?

45:51.839 --> 45:52.969
Did everyone go somewhere?

45:57.540 --> 45:59.040
We're all going fishing to catch webfoot octopuses.

45:59.339 --> 46:00.540
Come to the dock right away.

46:00.580 --> 46:02.009
We have to set out in 30 minutes.

46:02.480 --> 46:04.179
What is it? What did it say?

46:06.650 --> 46:07.989
They want to go fishing for webfoot octopuses.

46:08.089 --> 46:09.150
Really?

46:10.819 --> 46:12.719
Then should I change into something else?

46:16.929 --> 46:18.060
Do you want to go?

46:19.529 --> 46:20.730
I don't want to go.

46:30.909 --> 46:33.040
It's been 30 minutes already. Why aren't they coming?

46:37.650 --> 46:38.819
I knew it.

46:39.920 --> 46:41.819
I knew this would happen. Gosh.

46:46.219 --> 46:47.790
Dad. Let's go.

46:48.029 --> 46:49.560
- Go.
- Okay.

46:50.130 --> 46:51.759
Remove the rope. Then get on the boat quickly.

46:52.299 --> 46:54.369
- Let's go.
- Wait. We're not taking them?

46:54.369 --> 46:55.569
Hey, I don't want to go either.

46:55.699 --> 46:56.770
- No.
- Hey.

46:56.770 --> 46:58.469
You need to go and catch the webfoot octopuses with us.

46:58.469 --> 46:59.600
- Go back in.
- Gosh.

47:02.009 --> 47:03.739
Dad, let's go!

47:05.480 --> 47:06.610
My friend.

47:06.980 --> 47:08.679
Have a blast!

47:09.909 --> 47:11.779
- No!
- Gosh.

47:12.219 --> 47:14.049
No!

47:26.299 --> 47:29.069
Do you want to catch a cold? Why didn't you dry your hair?

47:30.170 --> 47:32.270
How can I dry my hair? I don't know where the dryer is.

47:32.270 --> 47:33.500
It's not my house.

47:39.279 --> 47:40.339
Come here.

47:43.310 --> 47:44.480
Eat them.

47:55.089 --> 47:57.089
Why are you staring at me? Have the strawberries.

47:57.360 --> 47:58.429
Just because.

48:04.569 --> 48:05.739
By the way,

48:06.000 --> 48:07.670
you won't have to use the hair conditioner.

48:07.969 --> 48:09.239
There was no hair conditioner.

48:09.270 --> 48:10.440
Because you're in perfect condition.

48:10.710 --> 48:12.139
You've been going easy with those cringy jokes.

48:12.710 --> 48:15.049
- Wait. Are you a deer?
- What is it this time?

48:15.049 --> 48:17.549
Why do you keep melting my heart, my sweet dear?

48:21.949 --> 48:23.150
It's embarrassing, so stop it.

48:23.150 --> 48:24.360
Wait. You're not laughing.

48:24.889 --> 48:26.860
Gosh, you smell so nice.

48:27.690 --> 48:29.659
- Like the perfect boyfriend?
- Correct.

48:31.860 --> 48:32.929
You find these jokes funny?

48:32.929 --> 48:34.100
I'm trying to make you laugh.

48:34.100 --> 48:36.130
These jokes used to make you laugh all the time.

48:38.699 --> 48:39.739
No strawberries for me?

49:18.679 --> 49:19.710
Soondol!

49:20.940 --> 49:23.049
Where... Go in there.

49:33.089 --> 49:35.389
Then I should go inside and get some sleep.

49:35.929 --> 49:37.060
Where will you sleep?

49:39.560 --> 49:43.000
In Hyuk's parents told me to sleep in the guest room.

49:43.469 --> 49:44.639
Sleep tight.

49:44.869 --> 49:46.000
Then...

49:46.739 --> 49:48.040
- where should I sleep?
- You?

49:53.210 --> 49:54.650
You can sleep in the tent there.

49:55.580 --> 49:57.009
- But I'm a guest too.
- What?

50:00.949 --> 50:02.020
Hey!

50:02.250 --> 50:04.150
So what?

50:04.150 --> 50:06.190
Are you saying you'll sleep in the same room?

50:09.330 --> 50:11.429
I was just joking. Don't look so shocked.

50:14.400 --> 50:15.500
Go in and get some sleep.

50:17.170 --> 50:18.299
But...

50:19.600 --> 50:20.799
call me if you're scared.

50:22.509 --> 50:24.270
Why would I be scared?

50:24.270 --> 50:25.339
Sol.

50:25.580 --> 50:27.139
You've never slept in a house in the countryside, right?

50:27.279 --> 50:28.810
It gets really scary at night.

50:28.909 --> 50:30.750
Because it's so quiet here, you can hear all kinds of things.

50:30.750 --> 50:31.850
You know,

50:31.850 --> 50:33.020
there are ghosts too.

50:35.119 --> 50:36.920
I see.

50:39.360 --> 50:41.020
But I'm not scared of ghosts.

50:44.190 --> 50:45.259
Sleep tight.

50:45.259 --> 50:47.100
(Love)

51:19.199 --> 51:20.460
No!

51:22.600 --> 51:24.199
What's wrong?

51:24.540 --> 51:26.139
I saw a ghost over there.

51:26.239 --> 51:28.210
- What? A ghost?
- Yes.

51:28.310 --> 51:29.610
A virgin ghost in the white dress.

51:30.210 --> 51:31.610
Didn't you hear the sound of the ghost just now?

51:37.810 --> 51:39.179
That was so scary.

51:39.679 --> 51:40.850
What if it shows up again?

51:42.290 --> 51:43.949
Is that so?

51:44.690 --> 51:46.020
Then I'll sleep in the tent.

51:46.219 --> 51:47.360
What?

51:49.259 --> 51:50.830
You want to sleep there where the ghost showed up?

51:51.190 --> 51:52.330
No.

51:55.069 --> 51:57.330
Are you worried that I might try something?

51:58.369 --> 51:59.869
You heard what my father said the other day, right?

52:00.040 --> 52:02.210
I'm pure like the oxygen.

52:02.440 --> 52:04.139
I didn't have any kinds of dirty thoughts. Not even...

52:05.980 --> 52:07.080
Not even a little bit.

52:08.750 --> 52:11.779
So you really came here because you're scared of a ghost?

52:11.779 --> 52:12.819
Yes.

52:13.880 --> 52:16.150
On top of that, it's really cold out there.

52:16.549 --> 52:17.889
Gosh, the draft...

52:17.889 --> 52:19.690
came over like this. So the tent went like this.

52:21.389 --> 52:23.560
The sandstorm kept coming into the house.

52:23.560 --> 52:25.259
I couldn't get any sleep. And the tent kept...

52:26.029 --> 52:27.230
You little...

52:27.230 --> 52:28.900
You could've said you wanted to be together.

52:28.900 --> 52:30.799
Why did you even try to lie when you're a bad liar?

52:31.940 --> 52:33.299
If I say so,

52:34.369 --> 52:35.540
would you let me sleep in here?

52:35.739 --> 52:36.869
No.

52:39.179 --> 52:41.380
All right. Look. I divided the room.

52:41.480 --> 52:43.080
I won't go over this line. Okay?

52:45.279 --> 52:46.520
This is nice.

52:47.449 --> 52:48.989
What happens if you cross over the line?

52:49.690 --> 52:51.290
Haven't you drawn a line on a desk in elementary school?

52:51.420 --> 52:53.819
Anything that comes over the line will be mine?

52:53.960 --> 52:55.130
So you know the rule.

52:55.130 --> 52:57.560
So you should also be careful not to cross the line.

52:58.529 --> 53:00.360
Aren't you tired? Let's go to sleep.

54:05.330 --> 54:06.799
Why did you come over the line?

54:13.040 --> 54:15.239
I guess I crossed the line.

54:15.839 --> 54:17.339
Remember the rule?

54:18.540 --> 54:20.639
Does it mean my arm...

54:20.639 --> 54:21.850
belongs to you now?

54:21.850 --> 54:22.980
It's mine.

54:25.279 --> 54:26.549
Here. Take it.

54:27.520 --> 54:28.850
But how will you take it?

54:28.889 --> 54:30.089
It's not like you can cut it off.

54:33.060 --> 54:34.159
You give me no choice.

54:40.299 --> 54:41.529
All of you should be mine.

54:48.710 --> 54:50.569
How nice. Let's go to sleep like this.

54:58.679 --> 55:00.150
What's this sound?

55:00.980 --> 55:02.520
That's the sound of the ghost.

55:03.920 --> 55:05.119
Dear me. I'm so frightened.

55:17.969 --> 55:19.069
Sol.

55:20.770 --> 55:22.170
Yes. Sun Jae.

55:23.670 --> 55:25.009
How long do we have left?

55:30.549 --> 55:31.750
I'm not sure.

55:32.750 --> 55:34.179
I hope you don't have to go back.

55:37.089 --> 55:38.360
I hope you get stuck in this time...

55:39.889 --> 55:41.319
and never go back.

55:44.529 --> 55:45.699
I don't want...

55:47.460 --> 55:49.500
tomorrow to come.

55:56.069 --> 55:57.469
Should we break the clock?

55:58.480 --> 55:59.610
Should we?

56:01.679 --> 56:02.750
Let's try that.

56:08.619 --> 56:09.719
Sun Jae.

56:10.619 --> 56:11.619
Yes. Sol.

56:12.860 --> 56:14.119
If...

56:14.989 --> 56:16.159
tomorrow...

56:18.600 --> 56:19.630
No.

56:20.699 --> 56:22.569
If today ends up being my last day here,

56:24.369 --> 56:25.770
don't be so sad.

56:28.569 --> 56:29.639
Okay.

56:30.210 --> 56:31.710
Don't cry. Okay?

56:33.810 --> 56:34.980
I won't cry.

57:07.480 --> 57:08.650
I like you.

57:11.210 --> 57:12.449
I thought I would regret it...

57:13.819 --> 57:15.790
if I left again without telling you how I felt.

57:18.989 --> 57:20.259
I like you, Sun Jae.

57:31.799 --> 57:32.839
I love you.

57:36.639 --> 57:37.739
I love you, Sol.

58:19.980 --> 58:21.080
You are...

58:22.049 --> 58:23.989
my last hope.

58:35.770 --> 58:36.900
What's this?

58:38.270 --> 58:40.069
Help me.

58:40.600 --> 58:41.869
Hey!

58:42.369 --> 58:43.839
Is that you, Mr. Ryu?

58:47.040 --> 58:49.310
Yes! It's me.

58:49.880 --> 58:51.279
Help me.

58:51.310 --> 58:53.549
Gosh. What's going on?

58:54.580 --> 58:56.119
Help me.

58:57.290 --> 58:59.920
I'm stuck in the bathroom.

59:00.619 --> 59:02.860
You're stuck in the bathroom?

59:03.259 --> 59:04.790
Oh, my. What should I do?

59:05.900 --> 59:09.199
You know what? Let me go in there and open the door for you.

59:09.199 --> 59:12.670
You can't come in here because the door is locked.

59:13.239 --> 59:14.739
Call 911.

59:15.270 --> 59:16.710
Call 911.

59:16.710 --> 59:17.739
Call 911?

59:17.739 --> 59:20.139
Call 911!

59:22.779 --> 59:24.250
Are you okay?

59:24.350 --> 59:25.520
Mr. Ryu!

59:26.679 --> 59:28.080
Mr. Ryu!

59:28.350 --> 59:29.690
Mr. Ryu!

59:30.819 --> 59:31.960
Mr. Ryu!

59:35.330 --> 59:38.190
Please call 911 now!

59:38.630 --> 59:39.860
The door is locked.

59:39.860 --> 59:41.400
Can't I just break down this door?

59:41.429 --> 59:44.429
I've tried, but it's not possible!

59:44.429 --> 59:45.739
I served in the Marines!

59:45.739 --> 59:48.440
I tried to use my firm body to break it down.

59:48.810 --> 59:50.670
But I think I fractured my shoulder.

59:50.670 --> 59:52.909
Okay. Step back.

59:53.009 --> 59:56.150
- Step back.
- Gosh. I think I broke my bone.

59:58.420 --> 59:59.920
Here it goes!

01:00:14.560 --> 01:00:15.770
Are you okay?

01:00:15.770 --> 01:00:16.869
Mr. Ryu.

01:00:17.969 --> 01:00:21.339
Thank you for rescuing me.

01:00:28.279 --> 01:00:30.779
Let's have the parboiled octopus for dinner.

01:00:33.049 --> 01:00:34.150
Bye,

01:00:35.089 --> 01:00:36.150
Sunny.

01:00:48.159 --> 01:00:49.369
Hey, Kim Tae Seong.

01:00:49.569 --> 01:00:50.600
Come already. Let's go.

01:00:52.900 --> 01:00:54.799
You should stay for one more day.

01:00:55.270 --> 01:00:56.940
I have to go back today.

01:00:57.069 --> 01:00:58.239
But I'll come back.

01:01:10.650 --> 01:01:11.960
Do you want to listen to music?

01:01:15.230 --> 01:01:16.360
Sol.

01:01:19.259 --> 01:01:20.360
Sol?

01:01:30.270 --> 01:01:31.569
Did you fall asleep?

01:01:31.670 --> 01:01:32.980
Where am I?

01:01:36.210 --> 01:01:37.310
What's wrong?

01:01:40.949 --> 01:01:42.790
What am I doing here with you?

01:01:47.860 --> 01:01:49.860
Sol. Why all of a sudden...

01:01:54.400 --> 01:01:55.630
Did something happen to you?

01:01:58.670 --> 01:02:00.699
Who are you?

01:02:01.040 --> 01:02:02.170
Don't tell me...

01:02:03.710 --> 01:02:04.839
Did you...

01:02:07.739 --> 01:02:09.150
go back?

01:02:10.049 --> 01:02:11.250
Let go of me.

01:02:12.819 --> 01:02:14.179
- Sol.
- Don't follow me.

01:02:15.449 --> 01:02:17.690
I'm a bit confused right now.

01:02:18.420 --> 01:02:20.089
I'll go back alone. I'm sorry.

01:02:48.549 --> 01:02:49.690
If...

01:02:50.589 --> 01:02:51.790
tomorrow...

01:02:52.460 --> 01:02:53.520
No.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:56.330
If today ends up being my last day here,

01:02:57.860 --> 01:02:59.259
don't be so sad.

01:03:00.360 --> 01:03:01.460
Okay.

01:03:03.199 --> 01:03:04.670
Don't cry. Okay?

01:03:07.369 --> 01:03:08.400
I won't cry.

01:03:56.319 --> 01:03:57.420
Im Sol!

01:03:59.119 --> 01:04:00.190
Sol!

01:04:00.319 --> 01:04:02.330
My future has changed.

01:04:15.540 --> 01:04:16.739
Sol!

01:04:17.139 --> 01:04:18.270
Sun Jae.

01:04:18.779 --> 01:04:20.139
What are we going to do?

01:04:23.610 --> 01:04:25.549
I'll change my fate on my own.

01:04:26.549 --> 01:04:27.880
Sun Jae.

01:04:28.850 --> 01:04:29.889
This time,

01:04:30.290 --> 01:04:31.449
please don't come to me.

01:05:34.679 --> 01:05:37.589
(Lovely Runner)

01:05:37.589 --> 01:05:40.460
We can meet again in the future and come back here.

01:05:40.659 --> 01:05:44.389
I desperately hope this isn't the last time.

01:05:44.389 --> 01:05:46.560
She said she was with me?

01:05:46.630 --> 01:05:49.230
Sun Jae. Where's Sol right now?

01:05:49.529 --> 01:05:51.170
She pretended to have gone back.

01:05:51.170 --> 01:05:53.670
Detective, please save me.

01:05:55.000 --> 01:05:57.239
Do you really believe Kim Young Soo will show up here today?

01:05:57.710 --> 01:05:59.779
Did her future change?

01:06:00.540 --> 01:06:01.980
Sun Jae!

01:06:02.880 --> 01:06:03.980
Sol!

01:06:04.509 --> 01:06:05.619
Sun Jae.

01:06:05.949 --> 01:06:07.279
Perhaps,

01:06:07.549 --> 01:06:09.850
we should have never met in the first place.

01:06:10.826 --> 01:06:12.826
Dramaday.me
